      <abstract id="aspace_9714fd257aaf4726233975418fc6582b">The collection contains correspondence, reports, journals, lists, pamphlets and broadsides, and other papers relating to Michel Bégon and French colonial administration in the Caribbean, French maritime commerce, foreign relations, domestic economic matters, and botany in the 17th century.</abstract>
      <langmaterial id="aspace_3b49f81776052e4c3b93f6d311c13b57">In French, with a small amount of material in Italian.</langmaterial>
    </did>
    <dsc>
      <c01 id="aspace_6f1b70e908321a861e0360d06f362d0d" level="series">
        <did>
          <unittitle>Correspondence, Reports, and Other Papers of Michel Bégon</unittitle>
          <unitid>1</unitid>
          <physdesc altrender="whole">
            <extent altrender="materialtype spaceoccupied">2.34 Linear Feet</extent>
