          <unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1651/1718" type="inclusive">circa 1651-1718</unitdate>
        </did>
        <scopecontent id="aspace_623723fbb40e57ce49dc0e952d125e9f">
          <head>Scope and Contents</head>
          <p>This series contains correspondence, reports prepared by and for Michel Bégon, printed material, and other documents relating to French colonial administration and maritime commerce, the War of the Grand Alliance, activities of British and European navies, horse breeding in France, French papal relations, and the geography, manufactures, and agricultural production of the province of Auvergne. Included are a number of reports providing intelligence on the Spanish fleet in the Caribbean and Spanish commercial interests, such as salt and silver mines, tobacco, and silk. The series additionally contains a report on the Ottoman Empire from Constantinople (now Istanbul), a small amount of drawings and maps, and papers related to botany.</p>
        </scopecontent>
        <arrangement id="aspace_d01acd86f6ff512fc9877560a5544bb7">
          <head>Arrangement</head>
